    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SkinCrawler Ranch is an Action Horror Fps, with a darkly humorous story. It started as a nice weekend camping trip. Now you are fighting for your life against horrific Cryptid forces! Only you can defend your Goth GF from what lurks at SkinCrawler Ranch!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced First Person Cryptid Hunting Action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808410/extras/055dc15864938ecf6f080fb6a15c8b4d.poster.avif?t=1752352076\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808410/extras/055dc15864938ecf6f080fb6a15c8b4d.webm?t=1752352076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808410/extras/055dc15864938ecf6f080fb6a15c8b4d.mp4?t=1752352076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of Cryptid Bosses and Enemies, designed by NateOrDie</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808410/extras/668889469897014e005e313bcafcdfdf.avif?t=1752352076\" width=616 height=430 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arsenal of Weapons for Slaughtering Cryptids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808410/extras/43392948f69a39a3ae6ebed09ce4a922.poster.avif?t=1752352076\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808410/extras/43392948f69a39a3ae6ebed09ce4a922.webm?t=1752352076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.